  "uncertainties": [
    "AUTOMATED CHECK: pagination is offset-based and the declared ORDER BY (due_date, id asc limit ?, ?) names no column that any UNIQUE index on the tables involved covers. Ties on due_date, id asc limit ?, ? can still be ordered inconsistently between two requests, which has the same effect as no ordering at all: page N can repeat or skip a row. This is a PRE-EXISTING CORRECTNESS RISK in the target application, independent of any patch."
